---
Blocks taken from github.com/cabralorenzo/bencho (free blocks, MIT) and MODIFIED for the open-sb playground:
slide-confirm, rolling-counter, context-meter, checklist, dynamic-island and label-input (each folder keeps the
block's .tsx, .css and README.md). The changes add data props and callbacks and remove the demo content, so
nothing fake can render; each one is marked in the code with an "open-sb change:" comment. Em dashes in the
original comments and READMEs were replaced with commas. Look and motion are unchanged.
